&lt;h5&gt;Current situation&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;current-situation&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#current-situation&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;During the past 24 hours, the organization has experienced several significant service disruptions affecting business-critical systems. While initial investigations have not established a definitive cause, the frequency and timing of these disruptions have raised concerns within the SOC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Separately, the SOC has identified a collection of indicators that have appeared repeatedly across security monitoring, investigations, and threat detection activities over the past two quarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Although none of these indicators has independently established a security incident, their recurrence, combined with the recent operational disruptions and emerging intelligence, warrants further investigation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Intelligence status&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;intelligence-status&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#intelligence-status&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Threat Intelligence team is conducting an ongoing assessment and will release additional intelligence in phases, prioritised according to relevance, confidence, and potential impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The SOC is expected to begin proactive threat hunting without waiting for the intelligence picture to become complete.&lt;/p&gt;
